  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; background: white;\">Rothco&rsquo;s Silicone Ring is the ideal solution for professionals seeking a safer alternative to traditional metal rings. Designed with both durability and comfort in mind, this tactical wedding ring is made from medical-grade silicone, offering a sturdy yet soft feel that is gentle on your skin. Its non-conductive material ensures safety in various environments, making it a reliable choice for those who work with electricity or heavy machinery. The sleek design of the silicone band maintains a professional appearance.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "359",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Silicone Ring is the ideal solution for professionals seeking a safer alternative to traditional metal rings. Designed with both durability and comfort in mind, this tactical wedding ring is made from medical-grade silicone, offering a sturdy yet soft feel that is gentle on your skin. Its non-conductive material ensures safety in various environments, making it a reliable choice for those who work with electricity or heavy machinery. The sleek design of the silicone band maintains a professional appearance while providing a secure and comfortable fit. Whether you're on duty or off, Rothco&rsquo;s Silicone Ring is the perfect way to wear your commitment with confidence and peace of mind.</p>",
